WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:11.400
There's a whole world inside of me
that's desperate to come out.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:18.480
I found a way to communicate this world
through making jewellery.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.200
For me, it is a language.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:28.600
At first, I took small steps,
as this craft was completely new to me.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:37.000
Eventually, I became more confident
in my ability to create,

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.960
an ability which
had always been there,

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:45.560
and I found a way to use my creativity
and discovered my own style.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:49.160
I soon realised that the craft
of making jewellery,

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:53.080
was my calling.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:01.280
Classical jewellery-making techniques

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:04.680
and traditional materials,

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:08.160
are still fashionable today.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:14.040
But I'm most interested in using materials

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:16.760
that are not considered as precious.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:26.160
I do like using metal,
but as a base material

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:30.480
which I build on top of,
with less conventional materials,

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.160
like resin.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:37.400
The resin I have been using
in my recent work is so versatile;

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:42.360
I'm still discovering new ways
to using it.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:47.800
All you need is patience,

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:52.640
and curiosity to discover
new ways of using the material,

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:57.040
in order to do things in a new way,
unique to your own craft.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:03.800
I like to combine classical techniques

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:08.360
with techniques that evolve
from my own experimentation.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.040
If I follow this method,
I know that whatever I create

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:18.440
will be a true and authentic

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.440
expression of myself,

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:26.600
resulting in jewellery that is unique.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:31.320
In a fast-paced world
that's constantly changing,

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:37.160
it's hard to keep people's interest

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.320
with things that may be considered
old-fashioned.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.640
But I think it is possible
to engage people with craft today.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.360
If you re-imagine traditional techniques

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:49.040
and find innovative ways of working,

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:53.480
the designs will be both unique

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:58.040
and relevant for today.

